05.09.26
We are thrilled to announce and invite you to our first fundraising paella event after this long break. It has been over a year since we last met, so we would love to see you all on September 5th (starting at 6 PM). We’ll also be celebrating the reopening of our beloved CLASH after its two-month closure for renovations. As always, we operate on a reservation-only basis; bookings can ONLY be made via email (el.socarraet@gmx.de) please specify whether you’d like the MEAT or VEGAN option and include your names.
The deadline for reservations is September 3rd
. We’re working hard to serve up an authentic Valencian paella (with a vegan option, of course), and we look forward to seeing you soon. Please don't hesitate to email us with any questions or to make a reservation. ALL proceeds will go toward covering legal costs for some Italian anti-fascist comrades.
THANK YOU SO MUCH, AND SEE YOU SOON!
