8626ad38-92a3-4f4a-b02c-5cef402b0daa,Roomers Bar,Berlin,Other,COCKTAIL,https://www.roomers-hotels.com/downloads/roomers-berlin-bar-menu.pdf,EXTRACTED,"A HEARTFELT WELCOME
TO ROOMERS BAR BERLIN.
Thank you for choosing to spend your evening with us.
Please make yourself at home – stay longer than planned,
order one more drink than you should, talk to strangers,
lose track of time.
Have the cocktail that sounds unfamiliar.
Order the late-night snack.
Have a Martini. Have two.
Listen to someone you may have nothing in common with
and share a drink anyway.
We believe the best bars are not only about what’s in the
glass, but about the moments created around it.
A place to celebrate, disappear for a while, fall in love
with a conversation, dance if you feel like it, and wake up
wanting to do it all over again.
Our menu is crafted with care by an incredible team, for
your pleasure.
Eat slowly. Drink well. Tip kindly. Check in on your
friends – and yourself.
And most importantly: enjoy the ride.
Freely adapted from Anthony Bourdain
