13e6b2ab-69a8-4eed-9dd1-67204f7a56c7,freebird Bar & Food,Munich,Cocktail,COCKTAIL,http://www.freebird-munich.com/#section_4,EXTRACTED,"freebird, bar and food | reopening on 11 may at 8 a.m.
WELCOME TO
news
Liebe Gäste,
freebird bar and food
ÖFFNUNSZEITEN!
di-sa ab 18h
wir freuen uns auf euch!
about us
Freebird Bar & Food
inspired by the song „freebird“ from lynrd skynrd freebird creates a relaxed environment where guests feel free to kick back and chill out.
the perfect mix of classic and contemporary music creates an easy-going atmosphere while a combination of modern and vintage furniture from the 60´s & 70´s the flowerpower wallpaper and fresh colours turn the bar into a casual livingroom.
start your day with a freshly brewd coffee or a fresh juice and breakfast delights. relish our home made cakes with a homemade lemonade.
take a seat on our small terrace and enjoy one of our secret-recipe-cocktails as you watch the sun set, or have a glass of excelent wine by the fireplace....
next to our variety of drinks freebird offers splendit crossover cuisine combining diffrent metropolitan influences with seasonal ingredients and fresh ideas.
freebird always seduces to turn a calm evening into a long rocking night.
